From: Audion contributors
Subject: [PATCH] wayland: restore iconic windows and import incoming file drops

Track received activation separately from acknowledged geometry, retaining
restore requests across coalesced configure events. FL Studio uses an iconic
160x31 minimized rectangle instead of the sentinel assumed by the old code.

Implement incoming local text/uri-list copy offers using Wine's existing OLE
and WM_DROPFILES bridge. Bound transfer IO on a dedicated waiting thread and
deliver imported CF_HDROP data on the destination GUI thread. Preserve clipboard
backend selection and serialize app dispatch across protocol timeouts.

